{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"39e63ff989ad17617d74118eff2b76d189b261f2f5041549b5c9aa3063e9c640","digest":{"component_or_area":"test_silent_success.py unit tests","key_entities":["test_reask_prompt_includes_bounded_prior_output","_pai_structured","_FAULTY_OUTPUT_SNIPPET_CHARS","FunctionModel","malformed output"],"problem_keywords":["test fragility","reask","retry logic","behavioral testing","private constant coupling","source inspection anti-pattern"],"propositions":["Current test pins private constant _FAULTY_OUTPUT_SNIPPET_CHARS and greps _pai_structured source, coupling to implementation details rather than behavior.","Test never executes an actual retry/reask, so it passes even if the reask mechanism is broken.","Replacement test must force malformed model output on turn 1, capture the turn-2 request, and verify prior reply is bounded and marked truncated only when necessary.","New behavioral test should use FunctionModel seams to inject the malformed reply, eliminating brittle source inspection.","Test must assert prior output is present, bounded to the cap, and [truncated] marker appears only when prior output exceeds the cap."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785824586918595007,"uuid":"9297c7cf-c6f1-442c-a433-c802349fb108"}